#: scenes/welcome/welcome.tscn
msgid "Timeline shortcuts"
msgstr ""

#: scenes/welcome/welcome.tscn
msgid "Everybody has their own editing style and shortcuts, feel free to adjust the shortcuts here. You can always change these later on in the settings menu."
msgstr ""

